OL,3,GNEWSABBC Nations boss champions Welsh
OL,4,Alanguage amid 'serious' cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC's new director of Nations says
OL,7,Fshe has "never seen such a serious
OL,8,Fsituation for the corporation" as it
OL,9,Fcommits to job cuts and axes
OL,10,Fprogramming across the UK in a bid to
OL,11,Fsave #500m.
OL,13,FRhuanedd Richards was confirmed as head
OL,14,Fof operations across the devolved
OL,15,Fnations and the English regions this
OL,16,Fweek following a temporary stint in the
OL,17,Fpost.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
