OL,3,GNEWSABBC Nations boss champions Welsh
OL,4,Alanguage amid 'serious' cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn September BBC Wales announced 58 job
OL,7,Fcuts and a 20-hour annual cut in TV
OL,8,Fprogramming, leading First Minister
OL,9,FRhun ap Iorwerth to warn the BBC could
OL,10,Ffall foul of its public service
OL,11,Fobligations.
OL,13,FRichards, a former chief executive of
OL,14,FPlaid Cymru, vowed to fight for the
OL,15,FWelsh language and its presence at the
OL,16,FBBC "while there is breath in my body".
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
